Package: dbsnR
Title: Tools for Reading and Managing Italian DBSN Geospatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Filippo",
        family = "Tani",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "filippotani@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Provides tools for reading, decoding, exploring, and locally
    managing geospatial data from the Italian Database di Sintesi Nazionale
    (DBSN). The package supports IGM File Geodatabases, coded attribute
    decoding, local caching, and the integration of data from multiple
    provinces.
